// Lvl-6 Enchant. Level, runes and xp are the wiki's, and the wiki's xp for Lvl-1..Lvl-5 is this
// table's numbers divided by ten, so 970 follows the same scale rather than being picked.
// The ring's anim and spotanim are the ones every other enchant-a-ring row uses. The amulet's
// spotanim is the cache's own enchant_amulet2_lvl6; its ANIM is inferred - the amulet2 family
// runs human_enchantamuletlvl1 at lvl4 and lvl2 at lvl5, so lvl6 takes lvl3. Flagged, not known.
